sshdeploy (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * deployweb: default PROJECT-DIR to current directory.
  * deployweb: auto-select profile by deploy name when config is omitted.
  * Build with Meson and derive package version from git tags.
  * Scripts: replace hardcoded version strings with Meson-rendered VER_DT.

